      "sequence_position": 1,
      "problem": "Consider the linear function $f(x)=\\frac{x}{2}-1,$ where $x$ is any real number. What is its range?\n\nThe range is \n{{field-1}}\n\n$<f(x)$\n{{field-2}}{{field-3}}.",
